content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Camp Administrator",
      "description": "Manages camp operations, enrollments, staff, and communication with parents"
    },
    {
      "name": "Enrollment",
      "description": "Record of a camper’s registration and participation in the camp"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camper",
      "description": "Child or participant attending the camp, linked to parents and activities",
      "attributes": [
        "Camper Records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Camper Records",
      "description": "All administrative and personal data about a camper",
      "attributes": [
        "Emergency Information",
        "Medical Information"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Emergency Information",
      "description": "Details for quick response in case of emergencies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical Information",
      "description": "Health-related data and medical needs of a camper"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Schedule",
      "description": "Overview of organized events taking place at the camp"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent",
      "description": "Registers and manages their child’s participation and communication with the camp"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp",
      "description": "The main entity representing the summer camp and its internal structure",
      "attributes": [
        "Activity",
        "Staff",
        "Camp Rules",
        "Camp Facility",
        "Camp Schedule"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Activity",
      "description": "Planned events, lessons, or games scheduled for campers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff",
      "description": "All people employed at the camp including counselors and workers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Rules",
      "description": "Guidelines defining expected behavior for campers and staff"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Facility",
      "description": "Physical locations and resources used for camp activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camper Group",
      "description": "Organized group of campers for easier supervision and activity planning"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent Feedback",
      "description": "Comments or suggestions parents give to improve camp services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Schedule",
      "description": "Planned timetable of activities and events for campers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Counselor",
      "description": "Staff member directly supervising and guiding campers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camp Worker",
      "description": "Handles camp operations, maintenance, and logistics"
    },
    {
      "name": "Report",
      "description": "Notes or alerts raised by camp staff about incidents, supplies, or behavior"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Camp Administrator",
      "to": "Enrollment",
      "description": "Camp Administrator manages Enrollment of campers"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Administrator",
      "to": "Parent",
      "description": "Camp Administrator communicates with Parent about registration and updates"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Administrator",
      "to": "Camp",
      "description": "Camp Administrator oversees Camp setup and operation"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Administrator",
      "to": "Camper Group",
      "description": "Camp Administrator organizes Camper Groups for activities"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Administrator",
      "to": "Camper Records",
      "description": "Camp Administrator maintains Camper Records"
    },
    {
      "from": "Enrollment",
      "to": "Camper Records",
      "description": "Enrollment links to Camper Records for tracking participant details"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parent",
      "to": "Enrollment",
      "description": "Parent completes Enrollment for Camper"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parent",
      "to": "Camper",
      "description": "Parent is responsible for Camper"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camper",
      "to": "Camper Group",
      "description": "Camper belongs to a Camper Group"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camper Group",
      "to": "Activity",
      "description": "Camper Group participates in Activity"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camper",
      "to": "Schedule",
      "description": "Camper follows Schedule of assigned activities"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parent",
      "to": "Schedule",
      "description": "Parent views Camper Schedule"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parent",
      "to": "Parent Feedback",
      "description": "Parent submits Parent Feedback"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parent Feedback",
      "to": "Camp Administrator",
      "description": "Camp Administrator reviews Parent Feedback"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parent",
      "to": "Counselor",
      "description": "Parent contacts Counselor responsible for Camper"
    },
    {
      "from": "Counselor",
      "to": "Camper",
      "description": "Counselor supervises Camper"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Worker",
      "to": "Report",
      "description": "Camp Worker issues Report about supplies or camper behavior"
    },
    {
      "from": "Report",
      "to": "Camp Administrator",
      "description": "Camp Administrator reviews Report from Camp Worker"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Worker",
      "to": "Camper",
      "description": "Camp Worker assists Camper as needed"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp Worker",
      "to": "Camp",
      "description": "Camp Worker works in Camp"
    },
    {
      "from": "Camp",
      "to": "Camper Group",
      "description": "Camp is organized in different Camper Groups"
    }
  ]
}
```
